type: software
title: "Configurable Prism-Array Four-View PSF Microscopy for Three-Dimensional Single-Particle Tracking"
abstract: "Analysis code for prism-array V4-PSF 3D single-particle tracking, including four-subimage localization, angle-primary axial calibration, QC, trajectory-level association, PSF/CRLB simulation, and seed-based QC/linking benchmarks."
